        <mxCell id="note_0" value="Trim and uppercase the code; use hotel-day&lt;br&gt;boundaries.&lt;br&gt;Require 4-20 letters/digits and a&lt;br&gt;description.&lt;br&gt;Discount: positive integer; percentage at&lt;br&gt;most 100.&lt;br&gt;Valid inclusive dates; end date cannot be in&lt;br&gt;the past.&lt;br&gt;Usage limit and minimum spend: nonnegative&lt;br&gt;integers.&lt;br&gt;Ignore client-supplied usedCount and&lt;br&gt;isActive." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;fontSize=11;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="843.1" y="568" width="300" height="180" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
